格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A Codex-style token usage dashboard for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) Web UI: 5 stat cards + a GitHub-style activity heatmap (daily / weekly) + insights + per-model usage ranking. The UI follows the DSH language setting: Chinese interface → Chinese dashboard, anything else → English.","id":"gh:1335123674","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-token-usage-dashboard","slug":"solstice621/dsh-token-usage-dashboard","topics":["cordis-plugin","dashboard","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","token-usage","usage-stats"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A Codex-style token usage dashboard for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) Web UI: 5 stat cards + a GitHub-style"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" activity heatmap (daily / weekly) + insights + per-model usage ranking. The UI follows the DSH lang"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"uage setting: Chinese interface → Chinese dashboard, anything else → English."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-token-usage-dashboard — Codex-style token usage dashboard"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A Codex-style token usage dashboard for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) Web UI:\n5 stat cards + a GitHub-style"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" activity heatmap (daily / weekly) + insights + per-model usage ranking.\nThe UI follows the DSH lang"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"uage setting: Chinese interface → Chinese dashboard, anything else → English."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **5 stat cards**: total tokens / peak tokens (single day) / longest chat / current streak / longes"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"t streak; auto-shrinking one-line values\n- **Heatmap**: 53×7 rolling grid (today pinned to the botto"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"m-right corner), hover for `Aug 15, 2026: 273k tokens · 34 requests`;\n**Daily / Weekly** view toggle"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" (weekly = bottom-up 7-cell bars, hover for the week total)\n- **Insights**: total turns, LLM request"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"s, sessions, active days, cache hit rate, avg tokens & duration per turn\n- **Favorite models**: prov"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ider/model token ranking (Top 5) with ratio bars\n- **Data source**: session logs (`assistant/message"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"` usage + `request/header` model attribution + `turn/start`/`turn/end` durations), live incremental "},{"id":"p6s8","text":"updates, persisted snapshot + incremental sync for fast restarts"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 🏗️ Architecture"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The plugin has two runnable forms that share the same aggregation logic:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Bundle form** (recommended for end users): installed via `dsh plugin add`; the npm package conta"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ins `lib/index.js` (host half) and `lib/client.js` (client half). The host half registers `GET /api/"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"token-stats` and `POST /api/token-stats/rescan` through `connection.fetch`, behind the Web UI's Host"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"/Origin and browser-session checks; the client half registers a \"Settings → Stats\" section and fetch"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"es the API.\n- **Dynamic-plugin form** (for maintainers/iteration): `host.js` and `client.js` are pas"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ted into `cordis_define` for in-session deployment without restarting the profile."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Data flow:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. Host subscribes to `session/event` / `session/created` and also performs an initial backfill over"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" historical session logs.\n2. It folds `assistant/message.usage`, `request/header` model attribution,"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" and `turn/start`/`turn/end` durations into in-memory aggregates.\n3. Aggregates are periodically flu"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"shed to the host JSON storage unit `token_stats` (normally `<DSH_HOME>/storages/token_stats.json`); "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"on restart the snapshot is loaded first, then only new events are incrementally folded. Older Harnes"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"s versions expose `sessionPersistence.readFrom` for suffix reads; versions without it use `sessionQu"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"ery.readSession` to read the full log while still folding only new events.\n4. The client polls `GET "},{"id":"p11s8","text":"/api/token-stats` (2s while scanning, 30s after ready) and renders the dashboard."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"An explicit rescan rebuilds from the current logs and replaces all aggregates only after every read "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"succeeds. Repeated or simultaneous rescans do not accumulate history again. Live events received dur"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ing replay are merged in sequence order. Normal restarts retain statistics for deleted sessions; an "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"explicit rescan removes that history when the logs are gone. A failed rescan preserves the last comp"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"lete result and reports an error."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Tests"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Run `npm ci && npm test` for regression tests covering both host implementations. The optional real-"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"Harness HTTP and native-storage integration tests require Node 24 and a Harness source checkout; see"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" TESTING.md for commands, the pinned contract revision, and coverage limits."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 🚀 Install (bundle)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Then open **Settings → Stats** for the full dashboard. Local install:\n`dsh plugin --profile web add "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"file:/path/to/dsh-token-usage-dashboard`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> On first open the plugin scans all historical sessions (seconds to a minute), then updates\n> in re"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"al time via `session/event`; the dashboard auto-refreshes every 30s — no manual action needed."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 🧑‍💻 Dynamic-plugin deployment (maintainers)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"This repo also maintains a dynamic Cordis plugin (`toksta-5`, deployed in-session via `cordis_define"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"`,\nhandy for iterating without restarting the profile):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Verify contracts with `cordis_inspect_list` / `cordis_inspect_query` (sessionQuery, session/event"},{"id":"p22s2","text":",\nsession/created, harness, React/host/styles builtins, settings.section, timer, locale);\n2. `cordis"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"_define`: `plugin.kind: \"new\"`, `idPrefix: \"toksta\"`, `code.host` = `host.js`, `code.client` = `clie"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"nt.js`;\n3. `cordis_run` (mode=`run`/`update`) to activate."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> ⚠️ The bundle and the dynamic plugin register the same settings section id (`token-stats`);\n> don'"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"t run both at once — stop one before enabling the other."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 📁 Files"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| File | Description |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `lib/index.js` | **Bundle host half**: folder + backfill + live listeners + `GET /api/token-stats`"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" (`POST /api/token-stats/rescan` as fallback) |\n| `lib/client.js` | **Bundle client half**: `window."},{"id":"p26s3","text":"__ModuleLoader__.load` factory, registers \"Settings → Stats\" |\n| `cordis.patch.yml` | bundle patch: "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"inserts the `id: token-stats` plugin row |\n| `package.json` | npm package manifest (`dsh.bundle` / `"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"dsh.client`) |\n| `host.js` / `client.js` | Dynamic-plugin host/client function bodies (paste into `c"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ordis_define`) |\n| `plugin.json` | Plugin metadata & package history (pkg-9 … pkg-27) |\n| `plan.md` "},{"id":"p26s7","text":"/ `progress.md` | Design docs & progress log (incl. every bug/fix) |\n| `assets/dsh-token-usage-dashb"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"oard.png` | Dashboard screenshot |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## ✅ Acceptance checklist"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- [ ] Settings → Stats: 5 equal-width cards, one-line values, aligned labels\n- [ ] 53-column heatmap"},{"id":"p28s2","text":", today at bottom-right, year-month-day hover tips; Daily/Weekly toggle works\n- [ ] Month axis align"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ed to columns; no horizontal scrollbar\n- [ ] Insights (7 rows) and Top-5 model ranking with bars cor"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"rect\n- [ ] New conversations show up within 30s\n- [ ] Language switch (zh ↔ en) relabels the whole d"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ersations show up within 30s\n- [ ] Language switch (zh ↔ en) relabels the whole dashboard on the fly"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🩺 Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Symptom | Cause / fix |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `pnpm not found on PATH` | `dsh plugin` needs pnpm: `corepack enable pnpm` (bundled with Node ≥16."},{"id":"p31s2","text":"und on PATH` | `dsh plugin` needs pnpm: `corepack enable pnpm` (bundled with Node ≥16.10) |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
